            <div xml:id="d414">

                <pb facs="0418" n="406" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg406"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/1143: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ford</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-24T16:00:00+03:25">May 24, 1944—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received May 24—2:08 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>366. My 359 May 22. Millspaugh and I both feel that note suggested in
                    Department’s 303 May 17, should be presented at once before he and I have our
                    next interview together with Prime Minister. I hope therefore Department will
                    telegraph authorization urgently.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ford</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
